                                                "sense_id": "7b3f005e-a2c8-3aa0-8b69-a6ad41560a0c",
                                                "text": "At a glance, Thor Steinar resembles waspy American pseudo-collegiate brands like Abercrombie and Fitch, Hollister, and Aeropostale, while displaying a distinctly Nordic aesthetics."
